      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on a piece about how automation is basically going to reshape the whole economy. i'm trying to frame the angle for the intro... do you think it's more accurate to describe the shift to an automated economy as an inevitable social evolution, or is it really just a matter of policy choice?",
